        <title>1:2_birthday_cake_2022</title>
        <link>https://alephnull.org/w/1/2_birthday_cake_2022?rev=1644463776&amp;do=diff</link>
        <description>Ideas for 1/2 birthday cake 2022 in Atlanta:

&lt;https://www.livewellbakeoften.com/red-velvet-cupcakes/#wprm-recipe-container-18093&gt;

&lt;https://www.cookingclassy.com/red-velvet-cake/&gt;

Cake flour contains the perfect amount of protein to give your cake structure and create the texture you're after.
Cake flour will result in lighter, fluffy cupcake. AP flour will be denser.</description>
